# ci/local.conf -- per-machine paths for the build and packaging scripts.
#
# Copy to ci/local.conf and edit. It is .gitignore'd, it is parsed as KEY=VALUE
# and NEVER sourced -- no shell code runs from a config file -- and anything
# already in the environment wins over what is written here, so a one-off run
# needs a variable rather than an edit.
#
# The image and emulator keys are spelled the way ../irixscsitb spells them, on
# purpose: the same private disk image and the same GitHub secret serve both
# repositories.

# ---- the IRIX boot image ------------------------------------------------------
# One of these. A local path wins; the URL is for CI, where the image is hosted
# privately and pulled down per run. These are licensed IRIX installs -- host
# them somewhere private (a private release asset, S3 with a signed URL, ...),
# never in a public bucket.
#IRIX65_IMAGE=/home/you/Indy-IRIX65_dev.chd
#IRIX65_DISK_URL=https://example.invalid/private/indy-irix65.chd

# ---- the emulator -------------------------------------------------------------
# A local build wins. Otherwise scripts/fetch-iris.sh downloads the prebuilt
# CLI from a release. Anything older than upstream 02c4e155 wedges the X server
# under capture load -- it does not matter for packaging, which runs headless,
# and it matters a great deal for anything driving the panel.
#IRIS_DIR=/home/you/iris-upstream
#IRIS_RELEASE_REPO=danifunker/iris
#IRIS_TAG=

# Only needed to attach to a guest somebody else started. The pipeline's own
# guest (scripts/iris-guest.sh) picks its own per-run socket so it cannot steal
# one from a developer's emulator.
#IRIS_SOCKET=/tmp/iris-rdagent.sock

# ---- the cross toolchain ------------------------------------------------------
# As mogrix's `setup-cross` deploys it.
#SGUG_STAGING=/opt/sgug-staging/usr/sgug
#IRIX_SYSROOT=/opt/irix-sysroot

# ---- the PowerPC agent tree ---------------------------------------------------
# The portable modules are included from it by #[path], so the two trees must
# stay siblings unless this says otherwise.
#PPC_AGENT_DIR=/home/you/repos/rustdesk/rustdesk-ppc-agent
